===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl=catfish|pl2=catfishes}}

# Any fish of the order ''[[Siluriformes]]'', that are mainly found in [[freshwater]], have no [[scale]]s and with [[barbel]]s like [[whisker]]s around the mouth.

